  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"載入器\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available-1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.1 | 1.21-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"適用版本\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1104430139275743293.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://iron431.github.io/Irons-Spellbooks-Docs/img/spellbooks-title-small-background.png\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p>《Iron 的法術與法術書》將經典的 RPG 施法奇幻體驗帶入遊戲中。與危險的巫師作戰、襲擊各種建築結構、深入地下城探索、收集資源與法術，並尋找強大的魔法神器！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>特色：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>超過 100 種可升級的法術</li>\n<li>2 位施法 Boss</li>\n<li>9 個會施法的敵人／盟友／商人</li>\n<li>12 套巫師護甲</li>\n<li>11 種隨機生成的建築結構</li>\n<li>武器灌注與護甲升級系統</li>\n<li>豐富的自訂選項（包含單一法術設定）</li>\n<li>原生支援 JEI、JEED、Apotheosis、Tetra、Better Combat、Patchouli 等模组！</li>\n<li>還有更多驚喜！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>常見問題：</h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>問：我該如何開始遊玩《法術與法術書》？</strong></span> <br>\n答：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.iron.wiki%252fprogression%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.iron.wiki/progression/</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>問：是否會移植到 1.20.1（或其他版本/模組載入器）？</strong></span> <br>\n答：簡短來說：不會。這些模组是開發者的興趣專案，為單一版本進行開發需要投入<em>數個月</em>的個人精力。不過，它們是開源軟體，並歡迎社群貢獻：<a href=\"https://github.com/iron431/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/iron431/</a>。您也可以透過 Patreon 獲得早期存取權限（<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/Iron431</a>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>問：我的模型破損或無法渲染</strong></span> <br>\n答：如果您安裝了 Optifine，那就是它造成的。Optifine 僅適用於原版客戶端。請改用其他與 Forge 相容的替代方案（例如 Oculus）。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/echo_of_the_flamebearer.png\" alt=\"Tyros\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/inscription_table.png\" alt=\"銘文桌\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/scroll_forge.png\" alt=\"法術鑄造台\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/structures.png\" alt=\"法術鑄造台\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/magic_loot.png\" alt=\"法術鑄造台\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/ancient_city_loot.png\" alt=\"法術鑄造台\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>給開發者：</h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firon.wiki%252fdevelopers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://iron.wiki/developers</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>支援：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/ad/essential.jpg\" alt=\"Essential\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252firon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1b3bc821-298d-4efc-96d2-7dff77d7069a.png\" alt=\"Bisect\"></a></p>",
